<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins mostly $2.00 lower; butts $3.00-5.00 lower; sknd. hams generally steady; sdls. bellies $1.00-2.00 lower; lean trimmings steady.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light demand and mostly moderate offerings. -USDA</p>
